          "1": {
            "id": "14083441",
            "headline": "Subscribe for Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd IPO; Anand Rathi",
            "heading": "Subscribe for Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd IPO; Anand Rathi",
            "intro": "Anand Rathi, has come out with its report on Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd The research firm has recommended to \u201c Subscribe\u201d the ipo in its research report as on November 18, 2026.",
            "body": "Anand Rathi, Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd\r\nMahanadi Coalfields Limited is the largest single coal-producing company in India in terms of production in Fiscal 2026, accounting for 21.0% of domestic coal production. A wholly owned subsidiary of Coal India Limited, the company operates primarily in the Talcher and Ib Valley coalfields of Odisha and produces various grades of non-coking coal, including washed coal, catering primarily to power utilities as well as industries such as cement, steel, aluminium and sponge iron. As of April 1, 2026, the company had audited coal reserves of 9,840.31 MT under the JORC Code, sufficient to sustain production for around 45 years at current production levels. The company operates 17 mines, comprising 14 opencast mines and three underground mines, with opencast mining contributing 99.85% of total coal production in Fiscal 2026. Its extensive mechanisation and industry-leading deployment of surface miners have enabled it to maintain one of the lowest production costs among Coal India Limited&#039;s subsidiaries.\r\n\r\nValuation and Outlook\r\nAt the upper price band, the company is valued at 8.4x FY26 P/E and 5.9x FY26 EV/EBITDA, implying a post-issue market capitalization of \u20b9900,097 million. Considering the company\u2019s market leadership, extensive reserve life, low-cost mechanised operations, strong profitability and infrastructure-led growth plans, balanced against the structural and regulatory risks associated with coal mining, we recommend a \u201cSubscribe \u2013 Long Term\u201d rating for the issue.\r\nFor all\u00a0IPO report,\u00a0click here\r\nDisclaimer:\u00a0The views and investment tips expressed by investment experts/broking houses/rating agencies on moneycontrol.com are their own, and not that of the website or its management. Moneycontrol.com advises users to check with certified experts before taking any investment decisions.\r\nMahanadi Coalfields -181126 - anand",
